@startuml
title edits clear — algorithm
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Read command and validate arguments;
if (Command syntax valid?) then (yes)
:Choose empty edit list;
:Build fresh candidate and replay to current position;
if (Candidate replay succeeded?) then (yes)
:Commit candidate and diffs, keep watches and breakpoints;
else (no)
:Report command error, original state and edits unchanged;
endif
if (Command completed without a command error?) then (yes)
:Display source, enabled sections, diffs and watches;
else (no)
:Display command error and return to prompt without state redraw;
endif
else (no)
:Display command error, keep current state;
endif
stop
@enduml
